  "name": "shadcn/ui",
  "description": "Add, search, compose, style and debug shadcn/ui components with the project's real configuration.",
  "longDescription": "Reads the project through `shadcn info --json` (framework, Tailwind version, base library, icon library, installed components) and works with the shadcn CLI. Activates in a project with a `components.json`.\n\n- **Rules** (6): `styling.md`, `forms.md`, `composition.md`, `icons.md`, `base-vs-radix.md`, `chat.md`, each with incorrect and correct code pairs\n- **References** (6): `cli.md`, `customization.md`, `design-system.md`, `design-system-page.md`, `registry.md`, `mcp.md`\n- **Design system pages**: showcase components and `scripts/showcase-coverage.mjs`\n\nCovers registries, presets, theming and the shadcn MCP server. By shadcn, MIT licence.",
